{
  "$comment": [
    "Intentional public API, per package. A symbol here may carry @public; anything",
    "else exported is internal machinery and carries @internal.",
    "",
    "Derivation, so this can be re-checked rather than trusted: the roots are the",
    "surface docs/versioning.md commits to keeping stable \u2014 the TableSource contract,",
    "the source builders, useDataTable and its prop-getter returns, the core types,",
    "BaseDataTableProps, the URL-state hooks and UrlStateAdapter, the column-layout /",
    "selection / sorting / pagination / virtualization hooks, the filter primitives and",
    "the labels contract. The rest of the list is the transitive closure of those",
    "roots' signatures: if a documented function hands you a type, you must be able to",
    "name it, so it is public too. Nothing outside that closure is public.",
    "",
    "scripts/api-allowlist.mjs enforces this against etc/*.api.md."
  ],
